CREATE INDEX idx_orders_user_created_at ON orders (user_id, created_at DESC);

This will allow an index-only scan for the WHERE and ORDER BY, avoiding the sort and the sequential scan. Optionally, you can include the selected columns to make it a covering index:

CREATE INDEX idx_orders_user_created_at_covering ON orders (user_id, created_at DESC) INCLUDE (id, total, status);

